From: Oichkatzelesfrettschen <151315375+Oichkatzelesfrettschen@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] handlers/__init__: register tactile_button_map

The new value_type "tactile_button_map" needs its handler module imported
in handlers/__init__.py for rivalcfg.mouse to find it.  This mirrors the
change in flozz/rivalcfg PR #133 (nixtux, "Add tactile button mapping for
the rival 700/710 [WIP]").

--- a/rivalcfg/handlers/__init__.py
+++ b/rivalcfg/handlers/__init__.py
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@
 from . import multidpi_range
 from . import multidpi_range_choice
 from . import multidpi_range_choice_xy
+from . import tactile_button_map
 from .buttons import buttons

 # flake8: noqa
